# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli string action on a computational basis state {#pauli-string-action-on-a-computational-basis-state}"
msgstr "Aksyon ng Pauli string sa isang computational basis state {#pauli-string-action-on-a-computational-basis-state}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The action of a Pauli string on a computational basis state is rather trivial, and is a single computational basis state itself. This is a direct consequence of the structure of Pauli matrices, which only have a single nonzero element on each of their rows. Consequently, their action on a qubit is:\n"
msgstr "Ang aksyon ng isang Pauli string sa isang computational basis state ay medyo simple, at ito mismo ay isang computational basis state. Direktang bunga ito ng istruktura ng mga Pauli matrix, na may iisang nonzero na elemento lamang sa bawat row nila. Kaya, ang aksyon nila sa isang qubit ay:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_x |0 \\rangle = |1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_x |0 \\rangle = |1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_x |1 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_x |1 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_y |0 \\rangle = i|1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_y |0 \\rangle = i|1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_y |1 \\rangle = -i|0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_y |1 \\rangle = -i|0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_z |0 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_z |0 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_z |1 \\rangle = -|1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sigma_z |1 \\rangle = -|1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"I |0 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"I |0 \\rangle = |0 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"I |1 \\rangle = |1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"I |1 \\rangle = |1 \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each bit on the bitstring labeling the computational basis will be labeled by $x \\in \\{0, 1 \\}$. In order to keep the implementation at light as possible, we will\n"
"represent the bitstrings with `bool` variables: $0\\rightarrow \\textrm{False}$ and\n"
"$1\\rightarrow \\textrm{True}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang bawat bit sa bitstring na nagla-label sa computational basis ay lalagyan ng label na $x \\in \\{0, 1 \\}$. Para panatilihing magaan hangga't maaari ang implementasyon, irerepresenta natin ang mga bitstring gamit ang mga variable na `bool`: $0\\rightarrow \\textrm{False}$ at\n"
"$1\\rightarrow \\textrm{True}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To represent the action of each Pauli operator in a computational basis state,\n"
"we will assign three variables to it: `diag`, `sign`, `imag`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para irepresenta ang aksyon ng bawat Pauli operator sa isang computational basis state,\n"
"magtatalaga tayo rito ng tatlong variable: `diag`, `sign`, `imag`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`diag` labels whether the operator is diagonal:\n"
msgstr "Ang `diag` ay nagpapakita kung diagonal ang operator:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{diag}(I) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{diag}(I) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{diag}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- `sign` Identifies if there is a sign change in the matrix element connected\n"
"to either 0 or 1:\n"
msgstr ""
"- Tinutukoy ng `sign` kung may pagbabago ng sign sa matrix element na konektado\n"
"sa 0 o 1:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{sign}(I) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{sign}(I) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{sign}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`imag` Identifies if there is a complex component to the matrix element:\n"
msgstr "Tinutukoy ng `imag` kung may complex na component ang matrix element:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{imag}(I) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{imag}(I) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_x) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{True}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_y) = \\textrm{True}$\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{False}$\n"
msgstr "$\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma_z) = \\textrm{False}$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We label an arbitrary Pauli operator as $\\sigma \\in \\{ I, \\sigma_x, \\sigma_y\n"
"\\sigma_z\\}$. The action of the Pauli operator on a computational basis state\n"
"can then be represented by the logic operation:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\sigma |x \\rangle = |x == \\textrm{diag}(\\sigma) \\rangle (-1)^{x\\textrm{ and sign}(\\sigma)}\n"
"(i)^{\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma)}.\n"
"$$\n"
"The same is straightforwardly generalized to arbitrary number of qubits.\n"
"Let's check that this works:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nilalagyan natin ng label ang isang arbitraryong Pauli operator bilang $\\sigma \\in \\{ I, \\sigma_x, \\sigma_y\n"
"\\sigma_z\\}$. Ang aksyon ng Pauli operator sa isang computational basis state\n"
"ay maaari nang irepresenta ng logic operation:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\sigma |x \\rangle = |x == \\textrm{diag}(\\sigma) \\rangle (-1)^{x\\textrm{ and sign}(\\sigma)}\n"
"(i)^{\\textrm{imag}(\\sigma)}.\n"
"$$\n"
"Direkta itong nagagawang general para sa arbitraryong bilang ng mga qubit.\n"
"Suriin natin kung gumagana ito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We generate some large number of bitstrings (50 M) for a 40-qubit system:\n"
msgstr "Gumagawa tayo ng malaking bilang ng mga bitstring (50 M) para sa isang 40-qubit na sistema:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmark SQD Pauli projection functions {#benchmark-sqd-pauli-projection-functions}"
msgstr "I-benchmark ang mga function ng SQD Pauli projection {#benchmark-sqd-pauli-projection-functions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Pauli string under consideration is $\\sigma_z \\otimes ... \\otimes \\sigma_z$.\n"
msgstr "Ang Pauli string na pinag-aaralan ay $\\sigma_z \\otimes ... \\otimes \\sigma_z$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Different subspace dimensions are considered by slicing the matrix of bitstrings. We time the subspace projection for the different subspace sizes.\n"
msgstr "Isinasaalang-alang ang iba't ibang dimensyon ng subspace sa pamamagitan ng pag-slice sa matrix ng mga bitstring. Sinusukat namin ang oras ng subspace projection para sa iba't ibang laki ng subspace.\n"

